# A copied struct whose field has another default in the target: compat sees the two defaults.
-- source.cue --
s!: {a: *1 | int}
-- target.cue --
s!: {a: *2 | int}
-- lens.cue --
input: _
result: {s: input.s}
-- out --
not total
result.s copies input.s, whose a fills with 2 when absent, where the source schema filled it with 1; an instance omitting the field copies the source's default beside the target's, and the two give it no single value (compat rule default-changed) (rule copy-narrowed) @ lens.cue:2:13
